 "text": "Hey! How's everything going? Nice idea. For small things, a card and a gift card works well. No one will know exactly how much. For smaller things, a card and a gift card works well. A general rule for a road is about a month's rent in total. Some places add on a full year. Then the wheel is probably worn. You can buy a new one for less than a full wheel replacement. You can also check the spokes. If you turn the wheel slowly and pull on the nipples with pliers, you can tell if they' loose.",
